    "lawCode": "Amd §§1676 & 1680, Pub Auth L",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S5938\n\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\n\nAn act to amend the public authorities law, in relation to the\nconstruction of facilities by the dormitory authority for Mercy\nFlight, Inc., of Western New York\n\n\n PURPOSE :\n\nThis legislation would permit the Dormitory Authority to provide\nproject management services for the construction of Mercy Flight,\nInc., of Western New York.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\n\nSections 1676 and 1680 of the Public Authorities Law are amended by\nadding Mercy Flight, Inc., of Western New York, to the Dormitory\nAuthority's enabling act.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nMercy Flight, Inc. of Western New York is a community-based\nnot-for-profit emergency air-medical corporation that has served the\nwestern portion of New York State since 1981.  Mercy Flight is an\nindependent operation, not affiliated with any hospital and provides\nall air-medical demands in the Western New York Region. Access to\nDormitory Authority financing will provide Mercy Flight, Inc. of\nWestern New York with cost savings related to the agency's aircraft\nand facilities.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
